      "isInner": false,
      "settings": {
       "editor": "<p>You know that feeling when you open something beautiful? The paper crinkles just right. The box smells expensive. The little details make you smile.</p><p>That should be your brand.</p><p>We make your labels (woven, printed, whatever feels right). Your hang tags. Your care instructions. Your boxes and bags if you want.</p><p>Sustainable materials if that's your thing. Premium finishes if that's your vibe. Just... you.</p><p><strong>What you get:</strong></p><ul><li>Labels that don't fall off after one wash</li><li>Packaging that makes people take photos</li><li>Details that scream &quot;this is a real brand&quot;</li></ul><p>The bulk order already will include price of packaging, labelling, shipping.</p>",
       "__globals__": {
